    description: "PlazaFlow will be a Cargo workspace: relay crate, Tauri app crate, FUSE guest daemon crate, Polis-lite WASM crate, shared types crate. Need to verify Rust analyzer traces cross-crate dependencies (use plazaflow_types::ChunkPointer across workspace crates). If analysis is scoped per-crate, it misses the most important edges. Existing work: WI-gahuk (Rust cross-file call resolution, done) fixed intra-crate cross-file calls. Gap may be inter-crate. Bakeoff repos: wasmtime (large Cargo workspace), firecracker (multi-crate VMM — directly analogous to PlazaFlow's libkrun usage), ripgrep (smaller workspace). Cross-refs: WI-gahuk (done, Rust cross-file calls), INV-kobad (Feature Parity Across Language Families)."  # 0262
